A1. The due that falleth once a month. ~ INSTALMENT
A10. Something schooners used to sail on. ~ GROG
A14. This is rather cloudy. ~ VAPOR
A15. One next to another, according to the poet. ~ AROW
A16. The hot-headed aviator flew into this. ~ RAGE
