A71. Bum days for the noblest Roman of them all. ~ IDES
A72. Soft show stuff. ~ SUEDE
A73. Lip. ~ SASS
A74. Speaking of legs—this ought to make a complete chorus in itself (plur.). ~ CENTIPEDES

D1. A shiny top-piece. ~ IVORY
D2. What college men have between their ears. ~ NAPES
D3. Back biting. ~ SPITE
D4. This would hang heavy on your hands. ~ TON
D5. This is spacial. ~ AREA
D6. These have their ups and downs on a ship. ~ MASTS
